  "text": "Sanguine Crawlers\n​\nIntroduction\nSanguine crawlers are a low level Slayer  mob found on top of the Blighted Cave, located in Havenhythe. They are mainly killed for the Havenhythe collection log.\n​\nStats\n⬥  level: 28\n⬥  XP per kill: 54.2\n⬥ Optimal kills per hour: ~1500 \n⬥ Optimal  XP per hour: ~81.3k \n​\nDesirable drops\n⬥ Vampyrism gloves \n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log.\n⬥ Tainted seed\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log.\n​\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOwning the following increases the efficiency of your sessions, but is by no means mandatory.\n\nItems\n⬥ Portable fairy ring \n    • Teleport to BKS and run northeast.\n⬥ Antisanguine\n    • Mitigates the damage of the schluurp mechanic if needed.\n⬥ Havensilver weapons\n    • Anything else deals reduced damage, may be used if downgrading gear.\n⬥ Oldak coil \n    • Make sure to have the Restocking Cannon ability unlocked.\nOther\n⬥ Access to boss portals\n    • Teleporting to Silverquill, the Dreadhog is the quickest way to reach the Blighted Cave.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nLocation and How to Get there\nSanguine crawlers can be fought on top of the Blighted Cave, located in Havenhythe.\n​\nBlighted Cave\n\n⬥ Teleport to Silverquill, the Dreadhog via a boss portal, exit the cave and head north.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• May alternatively use a  and teleport to BKS ‎then run northeast.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Place your  as shown above, your character will constantly be moving.\n​\nMethod: AFK Melee \nBefore loading your  and starting the session, check the following:\n​\n⬥ Ensure  and  are active at all times.\n⬥ Pray  and  or \n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Sustain  with  / \n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If using  you will need extra prayer sustain, use prayer potion drops as needed.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n\n​\nAbility Bar\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Sanguine Crawlers ​ Introduction Sanguine crawlers are a low level Slayer mob found on top of the Blighted Cave, located in Havenhythe. They are mainly killed for the Havenhythe collection log. ​ Stats ⬥ level: 28 ⬥ XP per kill: 54.2 ⬥ Optimal kills per hour: ~1500 ⬥ Optimal XP per hour: ~81.3k ​ Desirable drops ⬥ Vampyrism gloves ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log. ⬥ Tainted seed ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log. ​ Useful Items and Unlocks Owning the following increases the efficiency of your sessions, but is by no means mandatory. Items ⬥ Portable fairy ring • Teleport to BKS and run northeast. ⬥ Antisanguine • Mitigates the damage of the schluurp mechanic if needed. ⬥ Havensilver weapons • Anything else deals reduced damage, may be used if downgrading gear. ⬥ Oldak coil • Make sure to have the Restocking Cannon ability unlocked. Other ⬥ Access to boss portals • Teleporting to Silverquill, the Dreadhog is the quickest way to reach the Blighted Cave. ​ Location and How to Get there Sanguine crawlers can be fought on top of the Blighted Cave, located in Havenhythe. ​ Blighted Cave ⬥ Teleport to Silverquill, the Dreadhog via a boss portal, exit the cave and head north. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• May alternatively use a and teleport to BKS ‎then run northeast. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Place your as shown above, your character will constantly be moving. ​ Method: AFK Melee Before loading your and starting the session, check the following: ​ ⬥ Ensure and are active at all times. ⬥ Pray and or ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Sustain with / ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If using you will need extra prayer sustain, use prayer potion drops as needed. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee ​ Ability Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ​",
