      "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOwning the following increases the efficiency of your sessions, but is by no means mandatory.\n\nItems\n⬥ Portable fairy ring \n    • Teleport to BKS and run northeast.\n⬥ Antisanguine\n    • Mitigates the damage of the schluurp mechanic if needed.\n⬥ Havensilver weapons\n    • Anything else deals reduced damage, may be used if downgrading gear.\n⬥ Oldak coil \n    • Make sure to have the Restocking Cannon ability unlocked.\nOther\n⬥ Access to boss portals\n    • Teleporting to Silverquill, the Dreadhog is the quickest way to reach the Blighted Cave.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
